# Protected paths. This file is the code-level enforcement of the agent blast
# radius: an AI agent (or a tenant engineer) may open PRs touching the tenant's
# own business logic, but anything that could compromise the fleet requires
# platform-team review.
#
# Combined with branch protection ("require review from Code Owners"), an agent
# cannot: change its own core version, edit CI, reach deploy secrets, or alter
# the tier/channel that governs its rollout behaviour.

/tenant.lock            @trashlab/platform-team
/.github/               @trashlab/platform-team
/package.json           @trashlab/platform-team
/package-lock.json      @trashlab/platform-team
/CODEOWNERS             @trashlab/platform-team
/next.config.mjs        @trashlab/platform-team

# Everything below is the tenant's own surface — agents write here freely.
# /tenant.config.ts
# /extensions/
# /app/
# /migrations/
# /tests/
